{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22955","headline":"十二年冬江西温暖喜元八寄金石棱到因题此诗 · 白居易","name":"十二年冬江西温暖喜元八寄金石棱到因题此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今冬腊候不严凝，暖雾温风气上腾。\n山脚崦中才有雪，江流慢处亦无冰。\n欲将何药防春瘴，只有元家金石棱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}